
---

## ⚙️ **.gitignore**
```gitignore
# Folder dan file umum yang tidak perlu diunggah ke GitHub
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store

# File model besar
pest_classifier_cnn.h5
*.h5
*.hdf5

# File sementara Streamlit / TensorFlow
.streamlit/
checkpoints/
saved_models/
logs/
runs/

# Virtual environment
env/
venv/
.venv/

# File sistem IDE/editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.bak

# Cache dataset atau hasil output
*.npy
*.npz
*.csv
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
